of the explosion...

336
00:22:01.189 --> 00:22:03.974
The bridge explosion...
All of this is familiar.

337
00:22:04.018 --> 00:22:05.846
I think it happened
in my timeline.

338
00:22:05.889 --> 00:22:07.543
Mine. too.

339
00:22:07.587 --> 00:22:09.545
One of the longest bridges
in the world destroyed

340
00:22:09.589 --> 00:22:11.199
just after it was completed.

341
00:22:11.242 --> 00:22:13.046
That means this can't be
the attack that he was

342
00:22:13.070 --> 00:22:15.986
