382
00:25:10.334 --> 00:25:12.772
Sam Aurelius Augustus
Benedictus Kirk?

383
00:25:12.815 --> 00:25:16.123
Sam is his middle name.
Most people call him George.

384
00:25:16.166 --> 00:25:18.517
Absolutely no
one calls him George.

385
00:25:26.046 --> 00:25:27.961
Tiberius and Sam.

386
00:25:28.004 --> 00:25:30.330
- Your parents must really hate you.
- Oh. you're one to talk.

387
00:25:30.354 --> 00:25:33.575
La'An Noonien-Soong.

388
00:25:33.619 --> 00:25:35.882
- Singh.
- Whatever.

389
00:25:40.277 --> 00:25:42.018
You-you haven't heard it before.

390
00:25:42.062 --> 00:25:44.760
- What?
- Uh...

391
00:25:44.804 --> 00:25:47.937
Just the first time in a while
someone hasn't recognized it.

392
00:25:48.938 --> 00:25:51.680
Oh. Famous?

393
00:25:51.724 --> 00:25:55.336
- Infamous is more like it.
